<title>USA: Just for Feet Inc Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Just for Feet Inc Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, Ala. 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended</p>
<p>					  April 30,     April 30,</p>
<p>					    1997	    1996</p>
<p> Net Sales			     $ 92,803	$ 49,150</p>
<p> Franchise Fees &amp; Royalties	     207	     122</p>
<p> Selling, General &amp; Admin.	   31,400	  16,934</p>
<p> Net Income				 5,202	   3,175</p>
<p>Weighted Average Number</p>
<p>   of Shares			     29,580	  27,959</p>
<p> Net Income per Share		    0.18	    0.11</p>
<p>(in thousands, except per share and store data) Note: The company said comparable store sales for its superstores increased 5 percent for the first quarter of 1997 compared to the same period a year ago.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
